        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "\nconst g = $json;\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, blocked: true, message: g.message, problems: g.blocks,\n  note: 'NOT drafted: the pre-check flagged this text. Explain the reason to the owner in plain friendly words and offer the safe alternative from the message (or a rewritten version). Do not retry the same text.' } }];\n"
